<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#hienet_mptrj_training> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HIENet was trained on the MPtrj dataset (1.58M crystal structures) with a 95%/5% train/validation split for 250 epochs using the AdamW optimizer with cosine annealing learning rate schedule. The loss function combines Huber losses for energy, force, and stress predictions with weights λE=1.0, λF=1.0, λσ=0.01. An exponential moving average (EMA) of model parameters with decay 0.999 was maintained."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "PDF Sec 5 and Sec F.2 describe the full training procedure." ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.05771> .
